V.help=()=>`<div class="c"><h3>How it works · कैसे चलता है</h3><div class="step"><i>1</i><div><b>Shop Setup</b><div class="mu">More → Settings: add Shop Name, Phone Number, UPI ID and your own Bill Footer message.</div></div></div><div class="step"><i>2</i><div><b>Add Inventory</b><div class="mu">Items tab → Add item (type it, or scan the barcode: the name fills in by itself). New here? Load sample items or + 200 common kirana items from Home.</div></div></div><div class="step"><i>3</i><div><b>Make Bills &amp; Collect Payment</b><div class="mu">New Bill → search or scan items → apply discount → choose Cash, UPI, Card or Udhaar → Save. Then print the receipt (Bluetooth) or share it on WhatsApp.</div></div></div><div class="step"><i>4</i><div><b>Floating Calculator</b><div class="mu">Settings → turn on “Floating Calculator Overlay”. Drag the calculator button anywhere. On the New Bill screen, “Add to Bill” adds your result to the cart.</div></div></div><div class="step"><i>5</i><div><b>Khata &amp; WhatsApp Reminders</b><div class="mu">Khata tab: see pending Udhaar, record payments received, and send a payment reminder on WhatsApp with one tap.</div></div></div><div class="step"><i>6</i><div><b>Cash Tally (Daily Cash Check)</b><div class="mu">More → Cash Tally: count your notes at closing. The app compares it with sales, recoveries and expenses and tells you if cash is missing or extra.</div></div></div><div class="step"><i>7</i><div><b>Online Store Link</b><div class="mu">Home → Online Store Link: share the link on WhatsApp. Customers pick items and send the order straight to your WhatsApp. Send a new link if prices or stock change.</div></div></div><div class="step"><i>8</i><div><b>Data Security &amp; Backups</b><div class="mu">More → Backup every 30 days (keep the file safe in Drive or email). If something goes wrong, use the auto-snapshot restore.</div></div></div></div>
 <div class="c"><h3>Good to know</h3><div class="mu">• Your data is saved on this phone. You get a backup reminder every 30 days. You can also use More → Backup anytime.<br>• A USB or Bluetooth barcode scanner works: scan in the search box and the item is added.<br>• Low stock and expiry alerts show on Home.<br>• Online Store: tap “Online Store Link” on Home and share it with customers on WhatsApp. They pick items and the order arrives directly on your WhatsApp. If prices or stock change, share a fresh link.<br>• Scan &amp; Bill: scan any barcode, even items not in your stock list. Type name and price once; the app remembers it for next time.<br>• Bills older than 24 hours move automatically to backup on this phone and are deleted after 30 days.<br>• Cancelling a bill restores stock and Udhaar.<br>• Always have your CA check GST bills before filing returns.</div></div><div class="c"><h3>Terms &amp; Conditions</h3><div class="mu">Tap below to read the full terms.</div><button class="btn o" data-a="tcview" style="margin-top:8px">Read Terms &amp; Conditions</button></div>`;
